---
layout: "base.njk"
---
{% set totalNodes = collections.chapters | length %}

<section class="hero-box">
  <div class="hero-kicker">
    <span class="lang-en">UNIFIED THERMODYNAMIC ARCHITECTURE · {{ totalNodes }} INTERCONNECTED NODES</span>
    <span class="lang-zh">統一熱力學架構 · 全 {{ totalNodes }} 個環環相扣之邏輯節點</span>
  </div>
  <h1 class="hero-title">
    <span class="lang-en">The Open-System Physics Codex</span>
    <span class="lang-zh">開放系統物理學：傷寒與六經原始碼</span>
  </h1>
  <p class="hero-desc">
    <span class="lang-en">
      Classical Chinese Medicine is not a scattered collection of folk remedies—it is a single, airtight recursive operating system. Every node below locks into the next: from the <strong>1-2-5-6 Cosmic Codebase</strong>, through the <strong>19°C Urban Entropy Matrix</strong>, down to exact <strong>Jing Fang Gram Ratios</strong> and the <strong>3D Epistemology of the Dao</strong>.
    </span>
    <span class="lang-zh">
      傳統經方醫學並非零散的民間偏方，而是一套嚴密無間的遞迴作業系統。以下 {{ totalNodes }} 個章節環環相扣：從 <strong>1-2-5-6 宇宙原始碼</strong>，穿過 <strong>19°C 都市空調熵增母體</strong>，一路直達治療急症與深層伏飲的 <strong>經方精確克數比例</strong> 與 <strong>三維大道心法</strong>。
    </span>
  </p>

  <div class="archival-notice" style="background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.08); border: 1px solid #38bdf8; border-radius: 8px; padding: 0.9rem 1.15rem; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; font-size: 0.88rem; color: #e6edf3;">
    <span class="lang-en">
      <strong>[MASTER ARCHIVAL SPECIFICATION — FOR PRECISION ONLY]:</strong> This codex is written in high-density classical and thermodynamic notation for archival precision, not diluted mass-market explanation. All case demonstrations are strictly anonymized to pure cosmological coordinates and physical vectors. If any passage, canonical line, or proportional matrix exceeds your current baseline, copy the section into any frontier AI tool to decode and unpack the underlying mechanics.
    </span>
    <span class="lang-zh">
      <strong>【高密度主檔規範 —— 僅供精準查考】：</strong>本典籍採用高密度之古典經方與熱力學符號撰寫，旨在保存最高精準度之母本，而非面向大眾的通俗科普。所有案例演示均已完全剝離個人資訊，僅保留純粹之五運六氣座標與物理向量。若任何章節、經典條文或配伍比例超出您的現有理解基準，請直接將段落複製至任何 AI 工具中進行解碼與推演。
    </span>
  </div>

  {% set firstNode = collections.chapters[0] %}
  {% if firstNode %}
  <div class="hero-actions">
    <a href="{{ firstNode.url }}" class="btn-primary">
      <span class="lang-en">Start Sequential Reading (Node 01 → {{ totalNodes | padNumber }})</span>
      <span class="lang-zh">開始順序閱讀（節點 01 → {{ totalNodes | padNumber }}）</span>
    </a>
  </div>
  {% endif %}
</section>

<section class="controls-bar">
  <div class="search-wrap">
    <input
      type="search"
      id="matrixSearch"
      class="search-input"
      placeholder="Search herbs (e.g. Gui Zhi, Bai Shao, Fu Zi), symptoms, or physics vectors..."
      aria-label="Search chapters"
    >
  </div>
  <div class="module-filters" id="moduleFilters">
    <button type="button" class="filter-chip active" data-mod="all">
      <span class="lang-en">All {{ totalNodes }} Nodes</span>
      <span class="lang-zh">全部 {{ totalNodes }} 節點</span>
    </button>
    <button type="button" class="filter-chip" data-mod="I">
      <span class="lang-en">I. Cosmic Code</span>
      <span class="lang-zh">一、宇宙原始碼</span>
    </button>
    <button type="button" class="filter-chip" data-mod="II">
      <span class="lang-en">II. Urban Entropy</span>
      <span class="lang-zh">二、都市熵增</span>
    </button>
    <button type="button" class="filter-chip" data-mod="III">
      <span class="lang-en">III. Acute Exterior</span>
      <span class="lang-zh">三、表證急症</span>
    </button>
    <button type="button" class="filter-chip" data-mod="IV">
      <span class="lang-en">IV. Deep Hydrology & Dao</span>
      <span class="lang-zh">四、深層水液與大道終章</span>
    </button>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="puzzle-chain" id="puzzleChain">
  {% for post in collections.chapters %}
  <article
    class="node-card"
    data-module="{{ post.data.module_num }}"
    data-search="{{ post.data.title | lower }} {{ post.data.title_zh }} {{ post.data.summary | lower }} {{ post.data.summary_zh }} {{ post.data.keywords | lower }}"
  >
    <div class="node-rail">
      <span class="node-index">{{ post.data.order | padNumber }}</span>
      {% if not loop.last %}
      <span class="node-connector"></span>
      {% endif %}
    </div>

    <div class="node-body">
      <div class="node-header">
        <span class="node-mod-tag">
          <span class="lang-en">MODULE {{ post.data.module_num }} · {{ post.data.module }}</span>
          <span class="lang-zh">第{{ post.data.module_num }}卷 · {{ post.data.module_zh }}</span>
        </span>
        {% if post.data.keywords %}
        <span class="node-keywords">{{ post.data.keywords }}</span>
        {% endif %}
      </div>

      <h2 class="node-title">
        <a href="{{ post.url }}">
          <span class="lang-en">{{ post.data.title }}</span>
          <span class="lang-zh">{{ post.data.title_zh or post.data.title }}</span>
        </a>
      </h2>

      <p class="node-summary">
        <span class="lang-en">{{ post.data.summary }}</span>
        <span class="lang-zh">{{ post.data.summary_zh or post.data.summary }}</span>
      </p>

      {% if post.data.next_logic %}
      <div class="node-next-hint">
        {% if not loop.last %}
        <span class="lang-en">↳ <strong>Leads to Node {{ (post.data.order + 1) | padNumber }}:</strong> {{ post.data.next_logic }}</span>
        <span class="lang-zh">↳ <strong>銜接節點 {{ (post.data.order + 1) | padNumber }}：</strong>{{ post.data.next_logic_zh }}</span>
        {% else %}
        <span class="lang-en">↻ <strong>System Loop Complete:</strong> {{ post.data.next_logic }}</span>
        <span class="lang-zh">↻ <strong>系統閉環完成：</strong>{{ post.data.next_logic_zh }}</span>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </article>
  {% endfor %}
</section>

<script>
  (function() {
    const searchInput = document.getElementById('matrixSearch');
    const filterBtns = document.querySelectorAll('.filter-chip');
    const cards = document.querySelectorAll('.node-card');
    let activeMod = 'all';

    function filterNodes() {
      const q = (searchInput.value || '').trim().toLowerCase();
      cards.forEach(card => {
        const modMatch = activeMod === 'all' || card.dataset.module === activeMod;
        const textMatch = !q || (card.dataset.search || '').toLowerCase().includes(q);
        card.style.display = (modMatch && textMatch) ? 'flex' : 'none';
      });
    }

    if (searchInput) {
      searchInput.addEventListener('input', filterNodes);
    }

    filterBtns.forEach(btn => {
      btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
        filterBtns.forEach(b => b.classList.remove('active'));
        btn.classList.add('active');
        activeMod = btn.dataset.mod;
        filterNodes();
      });
    });
  })();
</script>
